{"id": 6368, "title": "My marriage", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "my-marriage", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/6368_my-marriage.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["刚结婚的时候，我只是一个普通的医生，我丈夫还是个中学老师，每天生活都很规律，我们俩每天早上起床后，一起吃早餐，看新闻，然后一起出门上班，生活很幸福。十年过去了，现在他已经是校长了，我也成为了医院的主任，我们的职位越来越高，工作也越来越忙，每天早上我起床后都看不到他，晚上我回家的时候他已经睡了。我们一起吃饭、交流的机会越来越少，偶尔见面，也不知道应该说什么了。曾经希望我们可以少一些会议，多一些休息，可以像以前一样经常在一起，但是大家都不愿意放弃自己的事业，最后我们只能离婚了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["剛結婚的時候，我只是一個普通的醫生，我丈夫還是個中學老師，每天生活都很規律，我們倆每天早上起床後，一起吃早餐，看新聞，然後一起出門上班，生活很幸福。十年過去了，現在他已經是校長了，我也成為了醫院的主任，我們的職位越來越高，工作也越來越忙，每天早上我起床後都看不到他，晚上我回家的時候他已經睡了。我們一起吃飯、交流的機會越來越少，偶爾見面，也不知道應該說什麼了。曾經希望我們可以少一些會議，多一些休息，可以像以前一樣經常在一起，但是大家都不願意放棄自己的事業，最後我們只能離婚了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["gāng jié hūn de shí hou， wǒ zhǐ shì yī gè pǔ tōng de yī shēng， wǒ zhàng fu hái shì gè zhōng xué lǎo shī， měi tiān shēng huó dōu hěn guī lǜ， wǒ men liǎ měi tiān zǎo shang qǐ chuáng hòu， yī qǐ chī zǎo cān， kàn xīn wén， rán hòu yī qǐ chū mén shàng bān， shēng huó hěn xìng fú。 shí nián guò qù le， xiàn zài tā yǐ jīng shì xiào zhǎng le， wǒ yě chéng wéi le yī yuàn de zhǔ rèn， wǒ men de zhí wèi yuè lái yuè gāo， gōng zuò yě yuè lái yuè máng， měi tiān zǎo shang wǒ qǐ chuáng hòu dōu kàn bù dào tā， wǎn shang wǒ huí jiā de shí hou tā yǐ jīng shuì le。 wǒ men yī qǐ chī fàn、 jiāo liú de jī huì yuè lái yuè shǎo， ǒu ěr jiàn miàn， yě bù zhī dào yīng gāi shuō shén me le。 céng jīng xī wàng wǒ men kě yǐ shǎo yī xiē huì yì， duō yī xiē xiū xi， kě yǐ xiàng yǐ qián yī yàng jīng cháng zài yī qǐ， dàn shì dà jiā dōu bù yuàn yì fàng qì zì jǐ de shì yè， zuì hòu wǒ men zhǐ néng lí hūn le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["When we first got married, I was just an ordinary doctor, and my husband was a middle school teacher. Our daily life was very regular. After we got up every morning, we would have breakfast together, watch the news, and then go to work together. We lived a very happy life. Ten years have passed, and now he is the principal and I have become the director of the hospital. Our positions are getting higher and higher, and our work is getting busier and busier. I can't see him when I get up every morning. When I go home at night, he is already asleep. We have fewer and fewer opportunities to eat and communicate together. When we meet occasionally, we don’t know what to say anymore. I once hoped that we could have fewer meetings, more rest, and be together as often as before, but no one was willing to give up their careers, so in the end we had no choice but to divorce."], "english_full": "When we first got married, I was just an ordinary doctor, and my husband was a middle school teacher. Our daily life was very regular. After we got up every morning, we would have breakfast together, watch the news, and then go to work together. We lived a very happy life. Ten years have passed, and now he is the principal and I have become the director of the hospital. Our positions are getting higher and higher, and our work is getting busier and busier. I can't see him when I get up every morning. When I go home at night, he is already asleep. We have fewer and fewer opportunities to eat and communicate together. When we meet occasionally, we don’t know what to say anymore. I once hoped that we could have fewer meetings, more rest, and be together as often as before, but no one was willing to give up their careers, so in the end we had no choice but to divorce.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gāng\" data-defn=\"just / barely / exactly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">刚</span><span class=\"tr\">剛</span><rt>gāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jié hūn\" data-defn=\"to marry; to get married\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">结婚</span><span class=\"tr\">結婚</span><rt>jié hūn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">